# openOODA design research papers

One research paper **per DESIGN.oot item** (main and sub-items).
Purpose: **justify why the item is in DESIGN.oot**, with problem, prior art, and openOODA rationale.

| Doc | Role |
|-----|------|
| `openOODA/DESIGN.oot` | Vision |
| monorepo `PM.oot` | Progress status per item |
| monorepo `SPRINT.oot` | Active engineering work |
| **this series (`RP-*`)** | Research justification per DESIGN item |
| **[tools/](./tools/README.oot) (`TP-*`)** | Process research for `ooda/TOOLS.oot` |
| **[meta/](./meta/README.oot) (`DOC-*`)** | Why control docs exist (DESIGN/PM/SPRINT/TOOLS/…) |

## Draft status (2026-08-09)

All **49** DESIGN leaf papers are filled as **`draft`** (not stubs).  
Cross-design fights and owner decisions: **[CONFLICTS.oot](./CONFLICTS.oot)**.

Promote individually: `draft` → `review` → `accepted` after human read.

## Status of papers

Baseline: all leaf papers are **`draft`**. Promote to `review` → `accepted` after human review. New DESIGN leaves start as `planned` stubs from TEMPLATE.oot.

## Template

Copy [TEMPLATE.oot](./TEMPLATE.oot) only if adding a new DESIGN leaf; prefer the pre-created stub for each ID.

